# Build context hygiene — the Dockerfile COPYs frontend/, crates/,
# migrations/ and scripts/ verbatim. Without this, host-resolved
# node_modules (darwin bindings) overwrite the npm ci install inside
# the image and the web build fails on a rolldown/napi mismatch.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/html-report
**/target

.git
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
